    "text": "The minimum value of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math> is",
