  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Now For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is decreasing as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is decreasing function&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is increasing as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is increasing function,</p><p>So, minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> lies in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Applying A.M <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8805;</mo></math> G.M in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math>we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi></math></p><p>Hence, the minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
